    "players": "2 to 4 players is optimal.",
    "deck": "106 cards (2 standard decks + 2 Jokers).",
    "equipment": "106 cards, score sheet, chips for stakes (optional)",
    "dealing": "Deal 13 cards to each player. One card is turned up to start the discard pile.",
    "hasPlaceholders": false
  },
  "rules": {
    "objective": "Be the first to meld all cards in hand ('Going Kalooki').",
    "gameplay": "1. **Opening Requirement**: The first meld(s) played to the table must total **40 or 51 points** (depending on house rules). Once 'open', you can meld any value.\n2. **Melds**: Sets (Groups) of 3-4 cards of same rank, or Runs (Sequences) of 3+ consecutive cards of same suit.\n3. **Joker Rules**: Wild cards can replace any card. Can be 'stolen' by replacing with the natural card.\n4. **Scoring**: Numbered cards (2-10) = Face value. Face cards (J, Q, K) = 10. Ace = 11. Joker = 15 points (or 25 as penalty).",
    "keyRules": [
      "First meld must total 40 or 51 points",
      "Sets: 3-4 cards of same rank (duplicates allowed from different decks)",
      "Runs: 3+ consecutive cards of same suit",
      "Jokers are wild and can be stolen by replacing with natural card",
      "After opening, can 'tack' (add) cards to any existing meld",
      "Winner scores 0; losers score points for cards remaining in hand"
    ],
    "hasPlaceholders": false
  },
  "strategy": {
    "basic": "Reach the 51-point opening as soon as possible. Use Aces (11 pts) and Face cards (10 pts) to hit the threshold quickly.",
    "intermediate": "Joker Fishing: Keep a card in your hand that could swap a Joker on the table. Even if it doesn't help your meld immediately, having a Joker in hand is a powerful defensive tool.",
    "advanced": "Discard Suppression: Watch your opponents. If an opponent has melded once, they can 'tack' onto your cards. Avoid playing cards that extend existing runs if you think an opponent is close to going out.",
    "tips": [
      "Aces are worth 11 pointsâ€”if you have three Aces, you hit 33 points immediately toward your 51-point goal.",
      "Don't discard a Joker! It's worth 25 penalty points and is too valuable to give away."
    ],
    "hasPlaceholders": false
  },
